---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Convera" description="About Convera Strategies, its perspective, purpose, and founder-led approach." canonical="/about/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="About Convera"
    tagline={site.tagline} title="Perspective for people, organizations, and institutions." lede="Convera Strategies is an independent, founder-led practice built around a simple premise: better decisions begin with a wider understanding of people, context, relationships, and institutional conditions." compact />

  <section class="section about-purpose" aria-labelledby="about-purpose-title">
    <div class="container about-purpose__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What Convera Is</p>
        <h2 id="about-purpose-title">A place for questions that do not fit neatly inside one discipline.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-purpose__copy">
        <p><strong>People are what we do.</strong> Convera begins from the view that organizations and institutions are ultimately experienced through people, relationships, communication, expectations, and trust.</p>
        <p>Organizations rarely experience problems in isolation. Workplace culture, communication, public expectations, institutional history, social conditions, and leadership decisions often overlap.</p>
        <p>Convera brings those relationships into view. Its work combines social perspective, workplace understanding, organizational strategy, research, and careful observation without forcing every question into a predetermined consulting model.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-pillars" aria-labelledby="about-pillars-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The Convera Perspective</p><h2 id="about-pillars-title">Three fields. One connected view.</h2></div>
      <div class="about-pillar-grid">
        <article class="card"><span>01</span><h3>Social Perspectives</h3><p>Look beyond the immediate issue to the institutional, community, cultural, and relational conditions surrounding it.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span>02</span><h3>Workplace Culture</h3><p>Examine how people communicate, interpret expectations, build trust, and experience organizational life in practice.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span>03</span><h3>Organizational Strategy</h3><p>Translate a clearer understanding of context into priorities, decisions, and practical next steps.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-context" aria-labelledby="about-context-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-context__heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Perspective in Practice</p><h2 id="about-context-title">Convera grows from engagement with institutions and public life.</h2></div>
        <p class="lede">The founder’s experience across research, teaching, service work, public institutions, organizational settings, and sustained professional conversation informs the perspective Convera brings to its work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-context__gallery">
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/editorial/about-fellowship-cohort.jpg" alt="A fellowship cohort gathered outside a public institution" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Institutional learning and public-service fellowship</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/images/editorial/about-public-conversation.jpg" alt="People in conversation at an institutional event" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Public conversation and institutional engagement</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-method" aria-labelledby="about-method-title">
    <div class="container about-method__grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">How Convera Works</p><h2 id="about-method-title">Understand before prescribing.</h2></div>
      <div class="about-method__copy">
        <p>Convera begins with context rather than a prefabricated solution. The first task is to understand what is happening, which relationships matter, what evidence is available, and where assumptions may be narrowing the view.</p>
        <p>The objective is practical clarity: define what matters, distinguish symptoms from underlying conditions, and determine which next steps are worth taking.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section founder-bridge" aria-labelledby="founder-bridge-title">
    <div class="container founder-bridge__grid">
      <div class="founder-bridge__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Founder</p>
        <h2 id="founder-bridge-title">Meet the person behind Convera.</h2>
        <p>Ryan Brown’s path into this work spans service occupations, military and law-enforcement experience, academic research, teaching, public institutions, and professional roles centered on people and responsibility. The personal profile explores how those experiences shaped the questions, values, and vision behind Convera.</p>
        <div class="founder-bridge__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="/profile/">View Ryan’s Profile →</a><a class="button button--ghost" href="/mission/">Read Convera’s Mission →</a></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="founder-bridge__portrait"><img src="/images/ryan-brown-about.jpg" alt="Ryan Brown, founder of Convera Strategies" width="1535" height="1024" loading="lazy" /></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .about-purpose__grid,.about-method__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.82fr) minmax(0,1.18fr);gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem);align-items:start}
    .about-purpose h2,.about-method h2{margin:.5rem 0 0}.about-purpose__copy,.about-method__copy{display:grid;gap:1rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}
    .about-pillars{background:var(--surface-soft);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
    .about-pillar-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}
    .about-pillar-grid article{padding:1.45rem}.about-pillar-grid span{color:var(--accent);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em}.about-pillar-grid h3{margin:.55rem 0 .7rem}.about-pillar-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem}
    .about-context__heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.86fr) minmax(0,1.14fr);gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem);align-items:end;margin-bottom:1.3rem}.about-context__heading h2{margin:.5rem 0 0}
    .about-context__gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:1rem;align-items:stretch}.about-context__gallery figure{position:relative;margin:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-soft)}.about-context__gallery img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.about-context__gallery figure:first-child img{aspect-ratio:3/2;object-position:center 48%}.about-context__gallery figure:last-child img{aspect-ratio:4/3;object-position:center 44%}.about-context__gallery figcaption{position:absolute;left:.75rem;bottom:.75rem;padding:.4rem .55rem;background:rgba(5,37,50,.8);color:#fff;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.04em}
    .about-method{background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
    .founder-bridge{background:var(--surface-soft);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.founder-bridge__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(300px,.8fr);gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);align-items:center}.founder-bridge__copy h2{margin:.5rem 0 1rem}.founder-bridge__copy>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:52rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.02rem}.founder-bridge__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem;margin-top:1.35rem}.founder-bridge__portrait{margin:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.founder-bridge__portrait img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 38%}
    @media(max-width:820px){.about-purpose__grid,.about-method__grid,.about-context__heading,.about-context__gallery,.founder-bridge__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.about-pillar-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.founder-bridge__portrait{max-width:560px}.about-context__gallery figure:last-child img{aspect-ratio:3/2}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
